-- Changed in 5.1.x:
-- * TK_NAME token order moved down
-- * string representation for TK_NAME, TK_NUMBER, TK_STRING changed
-- * token struct renamed to lower case (LS -> ls)
-- * LexState struct: removed nestlevel, added decpoint
